WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.081
This query checks email shape Missing values receive
a missing status

00:00:07.819 --> 00:00:14.104
Values matching the teaching-level regular
expression are labeled valid shape Other

00:00:14.130 --> 00:00:19.978
nonmissing values are flagged for review The phrase
valid shape is important

00:00:19.991 --> 00:00:22.965
because the regex does not prove the mailbox exists
